{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/5/b753e8412922d2d1b09296d555439987d31f2308.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2^{6x+3})(4^{3x+6})=8^{4x+5}\\]\" width=\"171\" height=\"19\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f785d7747c591a7e9e8e39f94f3dd4880e059298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)  zero} \\qquad \\text{(B)  one} \\qquad \\text{(C)  two} \\qquad \\text{(D)  three} \\qquad \\text{(E)  greater than 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"505\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/870968ce2ca83b83a75c4fda77d0e3aeb68c22ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{6x+3}\\cdot4^{3x+6}=2^{6x+3}\\cdot(2^2)^{3x+6}=2^{6x+3}\\cdot2^{6x+12}=2^{12x+15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"21\" />.\nWe also know that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d700fa7c02ff26bec5f8001f86e7ea0587dce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{4x+5}=(2^3)^{4x+5}=2^{12x+15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"19\" />.\nThere are infinite solutions to the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/3/e437cad40d7399a3b2c55503fb8bc14e8777e695.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{12x+15}=2^{12x+15}$\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889d052c5c898b4153c94f0a63269188dd7f9588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E)  greater than 3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"146\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHS